      "content": "calling someone just makes it feel more real, you know? like i have to pretend i'm still participating in the world. but i'm not. i'm just a ghost tending to another ghost. there's no \"potential\" left in this house. it's just... a long, slow, painful exit for both of us. i just want the noise to stop. i just want to be able to rest.",
